{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33388","headline":"寻僧元皎因赠 · 李昌符","name":"寻僧元皎因赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此生迷有着，因病得寻师。\n话尽山中事，归当月上时。\n高松连寺影，亚竹入窗枝。\n闲忆草堂路，相逢非素期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昌符","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}